level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: table\\_getFilteredSelectedRowModel()\n\n```ts\nfunction table_getFilteredSelectedRowModel<TFeatures, TData>(table):\n  | RowModel<TFeatures, TData>\n  | {\n  flatRows: never[];\n  rows: never[];\n  rowsById: Record<string, unknown>;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.utils.ts:272](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.utils.ts#L272)\n\nBuilds a row model containing selected rows from the filtered row model.\n\nIf no row ids are selected, an empty row model is returned without walking\nthe rows.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### table\n\n[`Table_Internal`](../../index/interfaces/Table_Internal.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n  \\| [`RowModel`](../../index/interfaces/RowModel.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n  \\| \\{\n  `flatRows`: `never`[];\n  `rows`: `never`[];\n  `rowsById`: `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>;\n\\}\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst selectedRows = table_getFilteredSelectedRowModel(table)\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: table_getFilteredSelectedRowModel\ntitle: table_getFilteredSelectedRowModel\n---\n\n# Function: table\\_getFilteredSelectedRowModel()\n\n```ts\nfunction table_getFilteredSelectedRowModel<TFeatures, TData>(table):\n  | RowModel<TFeatures, TData>\n  | {\n  flatRows: never[];\n  rows: never[];\n  rowsById: Record<string, unknown>;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.utils.ts:272](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.utils.ts#L272)\n\nBuilds a row model containing selected rows from the filtered row model.\n\nIf no row ids are selected, an empty row model is returned without walking\nthe rows.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### table\n\n[`Table_Internal`](../../index/interfaces/Table_Internal.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n  \\| [`RowModel`](../../index/interfaces/RowModel.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n  \\| \\{\n  `flatRows`: `never`[];\n  `rows`: `never`[];\n  `rowsById`: `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>;\n\\}\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst selectedRows = table_getFilteredSelectedRowModel(table)\n```\n"}
